# Stack: Rust HTTP

Package choices only. Trees and seams live in `rust-core` / `backend-rust-http-architecture-patterns`. Attach with the Rust HTTP preset.

| Concern | Choice | Notes / fallback |
|---------|--------|------------------|
| HTTP | Axum | |
| Async runtime | Tokio | |
| Middleware | Tower | |
| Serialization | serde / serde_json | |
| SQL | sqlx (PostgreSQL + runtime-tokio) | sqlx migrate when SQL is used |
| Domain errors | thiserror | |
| Binary-edge errors | anyhow | `main` / ad-hoc tooling only |
| Logging | tracing + tracing-subscriber | At the binary |
| L2 HTTP tests | `tower::ServiceExt` / `oneshot` against the router | |
